SUMMARY (Specification)

The bill of materials (JSON, CSV formats) and all supporting specification documents
are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (permissive attribution model).

Interactive BOM viewers (JSX components) are licensed under MIT (software license).

---

SPECIFIC FILES & LICENSING

| File | Format | License | Purpose |
|------|--------|---------|---------|
| bom_revS.json | JSON | CC BY 4.0 | Primary BOM (structured) |
| bom_revS.csv | CSV | CC BY 4.0 | BOM export (spreadsheet) |
| serenity-rev-s.jsx | JavaScript | MIT | Interactive BOM viewer |
| README.md | Markdown | CC BY 4.0 | Specification documentation |
| AGENTS.md | Markdown | CC BY 4.0 | Specification policy |

