ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENTS

When using or adapting the BOM, provide credit to Serenity UAV:

  "Bill of Materials sourced from Serenity UAV Project, licensed under CC BY 4.0.
   See [link to bom_revS.json or current-specification/README.md]."

